425		\[
426			\E_{\bx} \sum_{a,b} \bra{\psi}
427			(A^{\bx}_a - B^{\bx}_a)^\dagger
428			(C^{\bx}_{a,b})^\dagger C^{\bx}_{a,b}
429			(A^{\bx}_a - B^{\bx}_a) \ket{\psi}.
430		\]
431		Using $\sum_b (C^{x}_{a,b})^\dagger (C^{x}_{a,b}) \le I$, this is bounded by
432		\[
433			\E_{\bx} \sum_a \bra{\psi}
434			(A^{\bx}_a - B^{\bx}_a)^\dagger
435			(A^{\bx}_a - B^{\bx}_a) \ket{\psi}
436			\le \delta.
437		\]
